        },
        {
          "text": "Kukw ibi mubizi neza, yukw ata mushakanyi, cank’ igihumane, cank’ uwifuza (ni we asenga ibigirwamana), azogira ico aragwa mu bgami bga Kristo n’Imana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
